14. Construct a complete dispatcher block
=========================================

Task: After state mapping, add an i32 state slot and two complete new blocks. Preserve the old branch structure at this construction checkpoint.

### The template to start with

```cpp
bool changed = !phis.empty() || !escapingValues.empty();
if (!stateBlocks.empty()) {
    // TODO: allocate ms.state in the original entry.
    // TODO: append ms.dispatch and ms.invalid, not before entry.
    // TODO: terminate invalid; load state and switch in dispatcher.
    // TODO: add one case for each original state block.
    // TODO: changed = true.
