At this checkpoint, which original branches have been redirected?

A. Every branch in every function
B. Only an unconditional entry branch; state-block branches are unchanged
C. Only return instructions

Answer: B. This connects the first hop. Full flattening needs later successor-selection and state-transition rewriting.


17. Look up a Day 2 term
========================

